<title>USA: GTECH board authorizes stock repurchase.</title>
<headline>GTECH board authorizes stock repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>WEST GREENWICH, R.I. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTECH Corp said its board has authorized the repurchase of up to an additional $45 million of GTECH's outstanding common stock through the end of its 1998 fiscal year.</p>
<p>This is in addition to the $30 million repurchase authorization which previously was in effect for fiscal 1997 and which the Company expects will have been substantially utilized by the time its 1997 fiscal year ends on February 22.</p>
<p>It said it expects that repurchases will be accomplished through periodic purchases on the open market.</p>
</text>
